## Configuration examples

### Minimal production values

```yaml
database:
  postgres:
    type: external
    external:
      url: "postgres://agentregistry:changeme@pg.example.com:5432/agentregistry?sslmode=require"

resources:
  requests:
    cpu: 250m
    memory: 256Mi
  limits:
    cpu: 500m
    memory: 512Mi
```

### Production with connection string from a Kubernetes Secret

```yaml
database:
  postgres:
    type: external
    external:
      secretRef:
        name: my-db-creds
```

### Namespace-scoped RBAC

```yaml
rbac:
  watchedNamespaces:
    - first-app-ns
    - second-app-ns
```

